      "text": [
        " : سَأَلْتُ أَبَا اَلْحَسَنِ اَلْعَسْكَرِيَّ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ عَنْ رَجُلٍ أَوْصَى بِمَالٍ فِي سَبِيلِ اَللَّهِ فَقَالَ \"سَبِيلُ اَللَّهِ شِيعَتُنَا \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5478 - Muhammad bin Isa bin Ubaid narrated from Al-Hasan bin Rashid, who said:\nI asked Abu Al-Hasan Al-Askari, (Imam Ali ibn Muhammad Al-Hadi (as)) about a man who made a will to dedicate wealth \"in the way of Allah (swt)\" (fi sabeelillah).\nImam (as) replied: \"The way of Allah (swt) is our Shia (followers).\""
        ]
      }
